  "description": {
   "content": [
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "To reproduce: ",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "1. Create versioned resource ",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "attrs": {
      "language": "java"
     },
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "curl -i -XPOST  -H \"Slug: versioned_resource4\" -H \"Link: <http://mementoweb.org/ns#OriginalResource>; rel=\\\"type\\\"\" \"http://localhost:8080/rest\" -H \"Content-Type: text/plain\" --data-binary \"Test\"",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "codeBlock"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "2. verify that metadata versions endpoint returns 200 ",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "attrs": {
      "language": "java"
     },
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "curl -v -X GET http://localhost:8080/rest/versioned_resource4/fcr:metadata/fcr:versions",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "codeBlock"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "3. create a binary version against binary timemap",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "attrs": {
      "language": "java"
     },
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "curl -v -X POST  http://localhost:8080/rest/versioned_resource4/fcr:versions",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "codeBlock"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "4.  verify that the binary description timemap is there and is listing the newly created description memento ",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "attrs": {
      "language": "java"
     },
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "curl -v -X GET http://localhost:8080/rest/versioned_resource4/fcr:metadata/fcr:versions",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "codeBlock"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "5. Create a second binary description memento",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "attrs": {
      "language": "java"
     },
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "curl -v -X POST  http://localhost:8080/rest/versioned_resource4/fcr:metadata/fcr:versions",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "codeBlock"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "6.  Now call the binary description timemap ",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "attrs": {
      "language": "java"
     },
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "curl -v -X GET http://localhost:8080/rest/versioned_resource4/fcr:metadata/fcr:versions",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "codeBlock"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "It should return a 200. It returns a 404.",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "7. Now delete the previously created binary description memento.",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "attrs": {
      "language": "java"
     },
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "curl -v -X DELETE http://localhost:8080/rest/versioned_resource4/fcr:metadata/fcr:versions/<memento>",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "codeBlock"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "8.  Now call the binary description timemap again and verify that it now returns 200 with a listing of the original description memento.",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "attrs": {
      "language": "java"
     },
     "content": [
      {
