  "description": "<p>To reproduce: </p>\n\n<p>1. Create versioned resource </p>\n<div class=\"code panel\" style=\"border-width: 1px;\"><div class=\"codeContent panelContent\">\n<pre class=\"code-java\">\r\ncurl -i -XPOST  -H <span class=\"code-quote\">\"Slug: versioned_resource4\"</span> -H <span class=\"code-quote\">\"Link: &lt;http:<span class=\"code-comment\">//mementoweb.org/ns#OriginalResource&gt;; rel=\\\"</span>type\\<span class=\"code-quote\">\"\" \"</span>http://localhost:8080/<span class=\"code-keyword\">rest</span><span class=\"code-quote\">\" -H \"</span>Content-Type: text/plain<span class=\"code-quote\">\" --data-binary \"</span>Test\" </span>\r\n</pre>\n</div></div>\n<p>2. verify that metadata versions endpoint returns 200 </p>\n<div class=\"code panel\" style=\"border-width: 1px;\"><div class=\"codeContent panelContent\">\n<pre class=\"code-java\">\r\ncurl -v -X GET http:<span class=\"code-comment\">//localhost:8080/<span class=\"code-keyword\">rest</span>/versioned_resource4/fcr:metadata/fcr:versions</span>\r\n</pre>\n</div></div>\n<p>3. create a binary version against binary timemap</p>\n<div class=\"code panel\" style=\"border-width: 1px;\"><div class=\"codeContent panelContent\">\n<pre class=\"code-java\">\r\ncurl -v -X POST  http:<span class=\"code-comment\">//localhost:8080/<span class=\"code-keyword\">rest</span>/versioned_resource4/fcr:versions</span></pre>\n</div></div>\n<p>4.  verify that the binary description timemap is there and is listing the newly created description memento </p>\n<div class=\"code panel\" style=\"border-width: 1px;\"><div class=\"codeContent panelContent\">\n<pre class=\"code-java\">\r\ncurl -v -X GET http:<span class=\"code-comment\">//localhost:8080/<span class=\"code-keyword\">rest</span>/versioned_resource4/fcr:metadata/fcr:versions </span>\r\n</pre>\n</div></div>\n<p>5. Create a second binary description memento</p>\n<div class=\"code panel\" style=\"border-width: 1px;\"><div class=\"codeContent panelContent\">\n<pre class=\"code-java\">\r\ncurl -v -X POST  http:<span class=\"code-comment\">//localhost:8080/<span class=\"code-keyword\">rest</span>/versioned_resource4/fcr:metadata/fcr:versions</span></pre>\n</div></div>\n<p>6.  Now call the binary description timemap </p>\n<div class=\"code panel\" style=\"border-width: 1px;\"><div class=\"codeContent panelContent\">\n<pre class=\"code-java\">\r\ncurl -v -X GET http:<span class=\"code-comment\">//localhost:8080/<span class=\"code-keyword\">rest</span>/versioned_resource4/fcr:metadata/fcr:versions</span></pre>\n</div></div>\n<p>It should return a 200. It returns a 404.</p>\n\n<p>7. Now delete the previously created binary description memento.</p>\n<div class=\"code panel\" style=\"border-width: 1px;\"><div class=\"codeContent panelContent\">\n<pre class=\"code-java\">\r\ncurl -v -X DELETE http:<span class=\"code-comment\">//localhost:8080/<span class=\"code-keyword\">rest</span>/versioned_resource4/fcr:metadata/fcr:versions/&lt;memento&gt;\r\n</span>\r\n</pre>\n</div></div>\n<p>8.  Now call the binary description timemap again and verify that it now returns 200 with a listing of the original description memento.</p>\n<div class=\"code panel\" style=\"border-width: 1px;\"><div class=\"codeContent panelContent\">\n<pre class=\"code-java\">\r\ncurl -v -X GET http:<span class=\"code-comment\">//localhost:8080/<span class=\"code-keyword\">rest</span>/versioned_resource4/fcr:metadata/fcr:versions</span></pre>\n</div></div>",
